  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion, sliced carrot, zucchini, and bell pepper, sauté until softened about 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in five spice powder and curry powder, cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add rinsed barley, mix to coat with spices.",
    "Pour in vegetable broth and coconut milk, bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover, and simmer for 35 minutes until barley is al dente.",
    "Stir in a pinch of salt, adjust seasoning if needed.",
    "Remove from heat, let rest 5 minutes covered.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve with lime wedges."
